nodes.body:
@codex review

Retrying the failed review after the L20 rerun. Validation now includes baseline and patched runs with the actual CUDA engine: malformed checkpoints fail during loading, and valid ordinary and per-module-rank adapters preserve tokens and selected logprobs. The reused native build and the limits of the synthetic OPT check are stated there.

Please check the effective-rank lookup before name mapping and the flattened-MoE exception in particular.

